      <dt><a name="hmodel">H model</a></dt>
      <dd>Bolexcollector.com occasionally uses the term 'H model' or 'model H' 
        to encompass all Bolex cameras with at least a 100 foot film capacity, 
        regardless of lens mount type, film gauge or viewing system.</dd>
    </dl>
