    <dl> 
      <dt><a name="iris">Iris Diaphragm</a></dt>
      <dd>A curved series of metal blades in a photographic lens, controlled by 
        the <a href="#diaphragm">diaphragm ring</a>, which constrict and expand 
        in diameter to alter the size of the <a href="#aperture">aperture</a>.</dd>
    </dl>
