    <h1>M</h1>
    <dl> 
      <dt><a name="magneticstripe">Magnetic Stripe</a></dt>
      <dd>A narrow strip of magnetic oxide applied to processed film stock for 
        the purposes of recording sound.</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl> 
      <dt><a name="maxaperture">Maximum Aperture</a></dt>
      <dd>Size of the largest opening possible for a specific lens diaphragm.</dd>
    </dl>
